#: ../../source/index.md:4
msgid ""
"The AGIBOT D1 Edu & Ultra quadruped robot features 12 degrees of freedom "
"and supports a wide variety of locomotion gaits and stunt maneuvers. The "
"product also provides an open motion-control algorithm development SDK "
"and communication protocol, enabling users to perform secondary "
"development as needed."
msgstr "智元仿生四足机器人 D1 UltraEdu，拥有 12 个自由度，具有多种运动步态和运动动作。同时，本产品开放了运动控制算法开发 SDK 和通信协议，允许用户根据需要进行二次开发。"

